# Trivy ignore file for CVEs without available fixes in the Alpine base image.
# Review quarterly and remove entries once upstream patches land.
#
# To add a new entry:
#   1. Get the CVE ID from the Trivy SARIF output or CI logs
#   2. Verify no fix is available (check Alpine security advisories)
#   3. Add the CVE ID here with a comment explaining why
#
# Example:
# CVE-2026-XXXXX  # <description> — no upstream fix as of YYYY-MM-DD
